  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Thursday 10 December 2026 at 3:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nMotivated out-of-town vendor wants this property sold! All offers are invited by 10 December. You could be celebrating Christmas in your new home!\r\n\r\nIf you have been considering a brand-new terrace home but have concerns about privacy, outdoor space, parking or body corporate restrictions, this property offers a refreshing alternative.\r\n\r\n1/84 Long Drive is something a little different.\r\n\r\nSet on a generous 325m² fee simple (no body corp fees)  fully fenced site, this appealing home has its own individuality, interesting architectural design and, importantly, room to breathe. Enjoy your own garden, outdoor space and greater freedom without the restrictions and ongoing costs of a body corporate.\r\n\r\nProperty highlights include:\r\n\r\n• Elevated north-easterly aspect capturing all-day sun\r\n• Two generous double bedrooms\r\n• Two off-street car parks plus handy storage\r\n• Fully fenced rear garden – ideal for children, pets or entertaining\r\n• North-facing living and dining with excellent flow to the deck\r\n• A lovely glimpse of the harbour from the living area\r\n• Modern kitchen\r\n• Washing machine dryer and fridge, 2 heat pumps and HRV system\r\n• Separate laundry and guest WC\r\n\r\nSpace, sunshine, privacy and independence – all in one appealing package.\r\n\r\nYou could secure your own home and be settled in time for Christmas?\r\n\r\nCall today to arrange your viewing. This could be the one!",
